There's something between
those two buildings!

523
00:32:19,220 --> 00:32:22,040
Come on, Granny! Look! Look!

524
00:32:24,500 --> 00:32:25,330
Kokoro!

525
00:32:25,900 --> 00:32:26,730
Oh!

526
00:32:26,840 --> 00:32:29,460
If it isn't the pirate girl! Hey!

527
00:32:29,900 --> 00:32:32,677
Miss Pirate Lady! Look! Look over there!

528
00:32:32,760 --> 00:32:34,320
I see something!

529
00:32:35,020 --> 00:32:36,060
Like what?

530
00:32:37,340 --> 00:32:41,660
Just what are you going
on about, Jiminy? No way!

531
00:32:42,760 --> 00:32:43,977
What happened to the sea?

532
00:32:44,060 --> 00:32:44,980
It's dried up!

533
00:32:54,640 --> 00:32:55,470
Luffy!

534
00:32:57,380 --> 00:32:58,640
Hmm, that Straw Hat.

535
00:32:59,340 --> 00:33:01,987
Isn't that your king of
the pirates, Captain?

536
00:33:03,140 --> 00:33:03,970
Well?

537
00:33:06,080 --> 00:33:07,200
That idiot!

538
00:33:10,340 --> 00:33:11,540
Hey, hold on!

539
00:33:11,720 --> 00:33:13,077
Where do you think you're going?

540
00:33:13,160 --> 00:33:15,278
Don't go down there, it's dangerous!

541
00:33:15,680 --> 00:33:17,562
Are you trying to kill yourself?

542
00:33:17,720 --> 00:33:20,800
Awkwalakuna is gonna hit
at any moment! Come back!

543
00:33:24,420 --> 00:33:26,740
The pirate girl went down the stairs!

544
00:33:26,960 --> 00:33:28,019
What should we do?

545
00:33:28,220 --> 00:33:29,100
Come back!

546
00:33:29,380 --> 00:33:30,909
What if another wave hits?

547
00:33:32,760 --> 00:33:33,590
You
